# Equal deadlines leave in entry order ([LDET.5.11]). `Ev` is `scope ttl 1_s`
# under `+dynamic_ttl`, so expiry runs off the deadline heap. Four Evs share
# one deadline; Ev 1 is then retracted, which in libds moves Ev 4 into the
# heap root's hole, and the sweep at +1s expires 2, 3, 4.
#
# The trace prints `retract` with no identity, so the recordings cross-read,
# which compares the FactWithdraw records' fact ids, is what pins the order.
# @spec [LDET.5.11]
assert Ev id=1
assert Ev id=2
assert Ev id=3
assert Ev id=4
pump
retract 0
pump
advance 1000000001
pump
